<title>USA: Allied Bankshares OKs Regions Financial merger.</title>
<headline>Allied Bankshares OKs Regions Financial merger.</headline>
<dateline>THOMSON, Ga. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allied Bankshares Inc said Wednesday that its stockholders approved the merger of Allied and Regions Financial Corp, and all required regulatory approvals have been received.</p>
<p>Allied said the merger is scheduled to become effective on January 31.</p>
</text>
